  m_text: 'Citizens are encouraged to remain alert and report unusual behavior.


    Please
    notify local officials if you observe:


    - Irregular speech patterns

    -
    Discombort under inspection lights

    - Unusual eye coloration


    These
    signs confirm illness or mutation!


    Stay viligant, comrades!'
