  m_text: 'Residents reported a calm and uneventful evening across most districts
    last night. Power outages in the eastern blocks were resolved shortly after midnight.
    Authorities confirm no cause for concern.


    The United Border Authority reminds
    citizens that routine inspections are ongoing and cooperation ensures safety
    for all.'
